      "content": "therapists just want to fix you so you can go back to being a \"productive member of society\" or whatever. but there's nothing to go back to. the bridge is burned. i look around and there is literally no place for me in this world anymore. it feels like the universe has already decided i don't belong, and i'm just waiting for my body to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone.",
